  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Performance\n      - Replaced StorageData HTTP tokens with direct inline byte operations and UTF-8 (`u8`) literals.\n      - Optimized HTTP parsing with SIMD-accelerated searches and efficient 32-bit pattern checks for sequences such as CRLFCRLF.\n      - Optimized header parsing to use O(1) single-byte whitespace checks instead of `Trim()`.\n      - Removed redundant `MethodImplOptions.AggressiveInlining` attributes from trivial property getters and setters for cleaner code.\n      - Achieved sustained benchmark improvements under the same test environment: 180k+ requests/sec with stable memory usage below 30 MB throughout a continuous 10-minute stress test.\n      - Deprecated `StorageData`. It will be removed in a future release in favor of fully inline operations.",
